{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "no-longer-human",
  "chunk_id": "no-longer-human-chunk-0206",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "「明白了，不是說花朵裡雲捲雲舒……」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I get it, it is not clouds drifting through flowers...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "「是月亮裡雲捲雲舒吧。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is clouds drifting across the moon, right?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "「懂了，懂了，風對應花，是風，花的反詞是風。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I see, I see. Wind goes with flowers. It is wind. The antonym of flower is wind.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "「又錯！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Wrong again!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "那不是浪花節[1]裡的句子嗎？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Isn't that a line from naniwabushi?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "你的水平露餡了。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Now your level is showing.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "「不對，是琵琶。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No, it is a biwa.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "「仍然不對。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Still wrong.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "花的反詞嘛……應該舉世界上最不像花的東西才對。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "For the antonym of flower... you should name the thing in the world least like a flower.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "「所以，那是……，等一下，難道是女人？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "So that would be... wait, could it be a woman?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "「順便問一句，女人的同義詞是什麼？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "By the way, what is a synonym for woman?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "「內臟。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Internal organs.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "「看來你對詩歌一點也沒有研究。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It seems you have not studied poetry at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "那麼，內臟的反詞呢？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then what is the antonym of internal organs?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "「牛奶。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Milk.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00206",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "「這次回答得還算精彩，依次類推，再來一個。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That answer was fairly clever. Follow that line and give me another one.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
